      "text": "2025 Whee In FAN-CON TOUR [OWHEECE] in MANILA\n\n드디어 오늘이에요!\n교통이 혼잡할 수 있으니 신입사원분들은 여유 있게 이동해 주세요⭐️\n오후 6시, 잊지 못할 추억 함께 만들어요~\n\n🎤시간: 2025년 11월 08일 (토) 6PM (현지 시간)\n📍장소: SM North EDSA Skydome\n💳티켓: https://t.co/CMw9sUNPay\n\n⠿⠿⠿\n\n2025 Whee In FAN-CON TOUR [OWHEECE] in MANILA\n\nIt’s finally today!\nTraffic may be heavy, so please leave early to arrive on time, new employees⭐️\nLet’s make unforgettable memories together at 6 PM~\n\n🎤 Date: 2025.11.08 (SAT) 6PM (Local Time, Actual performance time based on on-site situation)⁠\n📍 Venue: SM North EDSA Skydome\n💳 Ticket: https://t.co/CMw9sUNPay\n\nOrganizer: O.N worldwide\nCo-organizer: Three Angles Production @Threeanglespro \n\n#휘인 #WheeIn\n#OWHEECE #OWHEECEinMANILA\n#ONworldwide\n#ThreeAnglesProduction",
