    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1987059439484993560",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1987059439484993560",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1987059439484993560",
      "text": "[8:23AM] #Okota_Isolo\n #TrafficUpdate\n\nFast vehicular movement from 5 Star to connect underneath the bridge of  Iyana Isolo.\n Daleko towards Mushin bridge is good to go.\n\nThe stretch from LASUTECH roundabout through Limca, Aiye, Omonije, College, Ishaga, Ile Ibadan, Ire Akari and Kogberegbe is a fast movement, same as the return journey.\n\nVehicular movement from Ilasa-Transformer to Apata junction is good to go.\n\nJourney on Cele Ijesha link bridge is good.\n Ilasa, Ballet and the stretch to Ijesha inward Mile 2 free.\n\nCele to connect Ago palace is free for now, return journey is a fast traffic flow as well \n\nInward and outward of Oke-Afa bridge inbound Pako is good.\nPako to connect Akiti and Chemist, Ago roundabout and Ibeh road is good to go, likewise return journey.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@lagostraffic961",
